# Files under public/ are served directly by Apache/Passenger, bypassing
# Express entirely (Passenger's standard convention: any file that exists
# under <PassengerAppRoot>/public/ is served by the web server, never
# reaching app.js -- so the cors() middleware there never runs for these
# requests). Locally-uploaded avatars/photos are drawn onto a <canvas> with
# crossOrigin="anonymous" (see src/lib/idCardRenderer.ts, ID card / signature
# rendering) -- without this header the browser refuses to load the image
# into the canvas at all, so the photo silently falls back to a blank
# initial-letter placeholder.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header set Access-Control-Allow-Origin "*"
</IfModule>
